784	   * Reads Entire's list of sessions for each repository that Entire hosts
785	   * and that has not been asked about yet. The Sessions view calls this when
786	   * it is shown, so nothing reads entire.io for it before then.
787	   */
788	  ensureRemoteSessions(): void {
789	    if (this.viewState !== 'ready') return;
