121	 * graph of its brain, and what the brain holds as plain text.
122	 *
123	 * The page runs no script and loads nothing. Its styles carry `nonce`, and
124	 * every piece of text is escaped, so nothing the plugin reports can become
125	 * markup.
126	 */
